TEXT 208 -56 Left 2 !;.ac dec 200 10 10Meg
TEXT -1128 16 Left 2 !; ===== PARAMETERS (optional for your PD sources) =====\n.param q=1.602176634e-19\n.param Itotal=10u\n.param alpha=0.5\n.step param alpha list 0 0.25 0.5 0.75 1\n \n; ===== KEEP VECTORS =====\n.option plotwinsize=0\n; ---------- keep vectors / names ----------\n.option plotwinsize=0\n.save V(outputnode)\n \n; ---------- NOISE: outputnode referenced to VSENSE ----------\n.noise V(outputnode) VSENSE dec 200 10 1e6\n \n; ---------- AC: transimpedance with IREF AC=1 ----------\n;.ac dec 200 10 10Meg\n \n; ---------- measurements ----------\n.meas NOISE NO_PWR INTEG V(onoise)*V(onoise) FROM 10 TO 1e6\n.meas NOISE NO_RMS PARAM sqrt(NO_PWR)\n \n; with AC=1 A, |V(outputnode)| = |Zt|\n.meas AC ZT_LF FIND mag(V(outputnode)) AT=100
